{"accountName": "奇安信CERT", "author": "奇安信CERT", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "奇安信 CERT 2026-11-17 17:06 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555uAQM0kLyUJxPmK3sLYNUEmHicbuaaFicgQwEKTUyz53zesX2Dc2kqnGkSKfVBJHkpciaqu9laUia2dhe8wf8IpYZy8pPt3ogreLVM/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "LibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555sYVZ2ib8XJf6rdiaJyib173rlT3C7sp8EjqZ2YDwwXhKNEdrTibHILEVEic976TYx5rZ4bPGWzRPjIukAmzWRDPdrIn5mbZpalIFGA/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007", "type": "p"}, {"text": "公开时间", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026-11-16", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响量级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "十万级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信评级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "高危", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVSS 4.0分数", "type": "p"}, {"text": "8.5", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "代码执行", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用可能性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在野利用状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未发现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "EXP状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "技术细节状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "危害描述： 攻击者可构造特制的 ODS 电子表格文件，利用表单自动加载、HTTP 外部 ODB 下载、SQL 转义绕过等特性，在用户仅打开文档时（无需宏警告或额外交互）实现任意代码执行，从而完全控制系统。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "LibreOffice 是一款免费开源的办公套件，由 The Document Foundation 维护，提供文字处理、电子表格、演示文稿、数据库和绘图等完整功能。它兼容 Microsoft Office 格式，支持跨 Windows、macOS、Linux 等多平台运行，广泛应用于个人、教育和企业办公环境，具备高度可扩展性和开放性。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.用户打开（或预览）攻击者构造的恶意电子表格文档（ODS/ODF）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "02", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "26.8 <= LibreOffice < 26.8.2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他受影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "03", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复现情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前， 奇安信CERT已成功复现 LibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007) ，截图如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "04", "type": "p"}, {"text": "处置建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全更新", "type": "p"}, {"text": "LibreOffice 26.2.* >= 26.2.7", "type": "p"}, {"text": "LibreOffice 26.8.* >= 26.8.2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "下载地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://www.libreoffice.org/download/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "临时缓解措施：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1.临时禁用 LibreOffice 中的 Java 支持（工具 → 选项 → LibreOffice → 高级）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2.避免打开来自不可信来源的文档，尤其是电子表格和包含数据库链接的文件。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "05", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[1] https://www.libreoffice.org/about-us/security/advisories/cve-2026-104692", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[2] https://www.libreoffice.org/about-us/security/advisories/cve-2026-104007", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[3] https://ii4gsp.github.io/libreoffice-rce/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间线", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年11月17日，奇安信 CERT发布安全风险通告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "07", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞情报服务", "type": "p"}, {"text": "「 奇安信漏洞情报平台 」 重磅上线，诚邀您来体验：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信 CERT", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于 第一时间为企业级用户提供 权威 漏洞情报和 有效 解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "本文已发布于NCC国家网络安全云社区 https://nccsec.cn/security-community", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击↓ 阅读原文 ，到 ALPHA威胁分析平台 订阅更多漏洞信息。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555uAQM0kLyUJxPmK3sLYNUEmHicbuaaFicgQwEKTUyz53zesX2Dc2kqnGkSKfVBJHkpciaqu9laUia2dhe8wf8IpYZy8pPt3ogreLVM/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月17日", "id": "831549339", "summary": "奇安信 CERT 2026-11-17 17:06 北京 \n致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。\n●  点击↑蓝字关注我们，获取更多安全风险通告。 \n漏洞概述 \n漏洞名称 \nLibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞 \n漏洞编号 \nCVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007 \n公开时间 \n2026-11-16 \n影响量级 \n十万级 \n奇安信评级 \n高危 \nC", "title": "【已复现】LibreOffice 远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-104692、CVE-2026-104007)安全风险通告", "ts": 1794906360000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508132&idx=1&sn=765cffd533b8087793a59834cabdc0dd"}